sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Authority portal
    participant F as Filing ledger
    participant B as Event bus
    participant W as Metrics warehouse
    participant D as North-star board

    F->>B: filing.submitted with our own timestamp
    P-->>F: acknowledgement carrying the authority timestamp
    F->>B: filing.filed with authority_ts_utc
    B->>W: event lands before the watermark
    W->>D: weekly figure published and sealed with a version
    P-->>F: receipt captured late, after the weekly seal
    F->>B: filing.filed correction as a new append, never an overwrite
    B->>W: event lands after the watermark
    W->>W: decide restatement or footnote against the materiality rule
    W->>D: restated figure published with a new definition-run version and a visible restatement note
    Note over W,D: A sealed period is never edited in place. Every published number<br/>carries the run version that produced it.
